---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const appStoreUrl = 'https://apps.apple.com/ng/app/chakam-chat-wrapped-red-flag/id6792742396';
const playStoreUrl = 'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.chakam.chatanalyzer';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Chakam — Chat Wrapped, Red Flags Decoded"
  description="Chakam turns your WhatsApp, Telegram, and DM chats into a private, on-device wrapped: who's more into who, red flags, reply speed, and more."
  active="home"
>
  <section class="hero-band">
    <div class="hero-wrap">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Your chat,<br>fully wrapped.</h1>
          <p class="tagline">Import a chat, get the receipts — who's more into who, red flags, reply speed, who ghosts first. Everything's read on your phone, not a server.</p>

          <div class="store-row">
            <a class="store-badge" href={appStoreUrl}>
              <img src="/assets/img/apple_icon.png" alt="App Store">
              <span class="store-text">
                <span class="store-eyebrow">Download on the</span>
                <span class="store-name">App Store</span>
              </span>
            </a>
            <a class="store-badge" href={playStoreUrl}>
              <img src="/assets/img/png-clipart-goggle-playstore-icon-google-play-computer-icons-android-play-button-angle-rectangle.png" alt="Google Play">
              <span class="store-text">
                <span class="store-eyebrow">Get it on</span>
                <span class="store-name">Google Play</span>
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="trust-row">
            <span class="trust-pill">🔒 100% on-device by default</span>
            <span class="trust-pill">🆓 Free to start</span>
            <span class="trust-pill">🚫 No account required</span>
          </div>

          <a class="hero-how" href="#how">See how it works &darr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual">
          <img class="phone-mock" src="/assets/img/Add_a_subheading_4_-removebg-preview.png"
               alt="The Chakam app showing a chat's Vibe Check, AI verdict, and Green Flag Report">
          <div class="float-card float-card--1">
            <span class="float-emoji">🚩</span>
            <div class="float-text"><strong>Red Flag Report</strong><span>Score, plus the receipts</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="float-card float-card--2">
            <span class="float-emoji">❤️‍🔥</span>
            <div class="float-text"><strong>Who's More Into Who</strong><span>Effort, ranked</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="float-card float-card--3">
            <span class="float-emoji">👻</span>
            <div class="float-text"><strong>Ghost Risk Meter</strong><span>See it coming</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-band">
    <div class="why-wrap">
      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-copy">
          <span class="kicker">Why Chakam exists</span>
          <h2>Stop decoding <span class="hl">mixed signals</span> on your own.</h2>
          <p>Chakam is an on-device AI chat analyzer built to turn a confusing conversation into clear answers — no guessing, no group chat poll, just your actual texts read by AI chat analysis that never leaves your phone.</p>
          <p>It tracks shifts in attitude and tone over time, effort and reciprocity, red flags, and ghosting risk — the patterns most people only notice weeks too late. It's a real chat analyzer, not a horoscope: every read is grounded in your own message history, not a generic script.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-card-label">Your chat with Rowland, decoded</span>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span>Compatibility</span>
            <strong>71%</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span>Interest trend</span>
            <strong>Rising ↑</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span>Vibe, last 2 weeks</span>
            <strong>Warming up</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span>Red flags</span>
            <strong>1 flagged</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span>Ghost risk</span>
            <strong class="stat-good">Low</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="emoji">🔒</span>
        <h3>On-device by default</h3>
        <p>Your chat export is parsed and scored right on your phone — the raw messages don't need to leave it to get your stats.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="emoji">🚩</span>
        <h3>Red flags, decoded</h3>
        <p>Ghosting, double-texting, one-sided effort — turned into a score and a receipt, not just a vibe.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="emoji">🎁</span>
        <h3>Wrapped-style recap</h3>
        <p>A shareable, Spotify-Wrapped-style breakdown of the whole relationship dynamic — built to send to your group chat.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="emoji">💬</span>
        <h3>Works with what you already have</h3>
        <p>Import a WhatsApp or Telegram export, or drop in screenshots from Instagram, Snapchat, Messenger, or iMessage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="emoji">⚖️</span>
        <h3>Who's more into who</h3>
        <p>Effort, response time, and initiation all rolled into one number — finally, a straight answer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="emoji">🔮</span>
        <h3>An AI verdict, not just numbers</h3>
        <p>A short, written read on the dynamic — grounded in your actual stats, not a generic horoscope.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="block" id="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="kicker">How it works</span>
        <h2>Three steps, one minute</h2>
        <p>No sign-up, no waiting on a server — the whole thing happens on your phone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">1</div>
          <h3>Import a chat</h3>
          <p>Export straight from WhatsApp or Telegram, or drop in a few screenshots from Instagram, Snapchat, Messenger, or iMessage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">2</div>
          <h3>Chakam reads it</h3>
          <p>Message counts, reply speed, double-texts, ghosting, red flags — calculated right there on your device.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">3</div>
          <h3>Get your wrapped</h3>
          <p>A full card deck plus a written verdict on the dynamic — save it, revisit it, or share the parts you want to.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="kicker">Supported chats</span>
        <h2>Bring the chat you've already got</h2>
        <p>Export-based sources are read directly; the rest work from screenshots.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sources-row">
        <span class="source-pill"><img src="/assets/img/sources/whatsapp.png" alt="">WhatsApp</span>
        <span class="source-pill"><img src="/assets/img/sources/telegram.png" alt="">Telegram</span>
        <span class="source-pill"><img src="/assets/img/sources/instagram.jpg" alt="">Instagram</span>
        <span class="source-pill"><img src="/assets/img/sources/snapchat.png" alt="">Snapchat</span>
        <span class="source-pill"><img src="/assets/img/sources/messenger.jpg" alt="">Messenger</span>
        <span class="source-pill"><img src="/assets/img/sources/imessage.jpg" alt="">iMessage</span>
      </div>
      <p class="source-note">More to follow — Tinder, Bumble, and Hinge are on the way.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="trust-split">
        <div>
          <div class="section-head" style="text-align:left; margin:0 0 26px;">
            <span class="kicker">Privacy first</span>
            <h2>Built so your chats stay yours</h2>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li><span class="tick">✓</span> Every metric on the result screen is computed locally, in the app.</li>
            <li><span class="tick">✓</span> Names are aliased before anything touches the network — never sent as-is.</li>
            <li><span class="tick">✓</span> Our servers don't store what they receive — nothing to leak, nothing to delete.</li>
            <li><span class="tick">✓</span> No ad networks, no trackers, no data resold to anyone.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="big">0</div>
          <p>chats stored on our servers, ever — by design, not by policy.</p>
          <div class="big">1</div>
          <p>place your analyses live: your own phone. Delete the app, and they're gone with it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
        <h2>Good questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Does my raw chat ever leave my phone?</h3>
          <p>No — the metrics and cards you see are calculated on-device. The only things that can leave are a small, aliased sample used to write the AI verdict, and screenshot images for sources that require OCR (Instagram, Snapchat, Messenger, iMessage) — full details in the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Do I need to create an account?</h3>
          <p>No. Open the app, import a chat, and you're straight into your results.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>What does the subscription unlock?</h3>
          <p>The free tier gives you a first set of cards on every analysis. Premium unlocks the rest of the deck — red flag detail, ghosting risk, reply-speed breakdowns, and the full AI verdict.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I delete my data?</h3>
          <p>Yes, anytime — "Clear all data" in Settings wipes everything stored on your device. We don't have a server-side copy to delete, because we never keep one.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="download">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="final-cta">
        <h2>Ready to see your wrapped?</h2>
        <p>Import a chat and get your full breakdown in under a minute — free to start, on iOS and Android.</p>
        <div class="store-row">
          <a class="store-badge" href={appStoreUrl}>
            <img src="/assets/img/apple_icon.png" alt="App Store">
            <span class="store-text">
              <span class="store-eyebrow">Download on the</span>
              <span class="store-name">App Store</span>
            </span>
          </a>
          <a class="store-badge" href={playStoreUrl}>
            <img src="/assets/img/png-clipart-goggle-playstore-icon-google-play-computer-icons-android-play-button-angle-rectangle.png" alt="Google Play">
            <span class="store-text">
              <span class="store-eyebrow">Get it on</span>
              <span class="store-name">Google Play</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
